NAME
File::Path - Create or remove directory trees

INSTALLATION
    perl Makefile.PL
    make
    make test
    make install

PREREQUISITES
All prerequisites are found in the Perl 5 core distribution.

To configure:
    ExtUtils::MakeMaker

To build:
    Cwd                         File::Basename
    Exporter                    File::Spec

To test:
    Carp                        File::Spec::Functions
    Config                      SelectSaver
    Cwd                         Test::More
    Errno                       Win32       # Windows only
    Fcntl

BUGS
The File-Path bug tracker is located at: https://github.com/jkeenan/File-Path

